#. FAQ answer explaining private-by-default saved-search watchlists and unlisted sharing.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: app/[lang]/(public)/faq/page.tsx
msgid "faq.a.whatIsWatchlist"
msgstr "A watchlist is a saved search with optional company filtering. Pick the companies you care about, set your filters (role, location, seniority, salary), and get a live feed of matching jobs. Watchlists are private by default; when you choose to share an unlisted link, anyone with the link can view the results and clone the watchlist, while only you can manage the original."

